Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:04.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Let's get it, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:04.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}よっしゃ、行くぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:05.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:05.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}おかえり
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:05.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:05.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}おう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}準備はいいか？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ああ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:08.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Let me just take you straight there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:08.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}このまま直接案内するよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:09.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:09.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We just won't even talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}もう何も言わないでおこう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We won't talk about the colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}色の話もしない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:12.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We won't talk about nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:12.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}一切ナシだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Kind of bringing it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}back to the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}昔ながらのやり方でいくよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We covered it because I didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}want you to sneak peek it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}チラ見されたくなかったから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}カバーかけといた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:19.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:19.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}マジか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:21.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:21.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}じゃあ、いくぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:22.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:22.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:22.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ヤバいな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:22.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}カバー取って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's the chocolate Lambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}これがチョコレート色のLambo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:37.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Travis, for reals, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:37.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Travis、マジな話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:40.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}it all comes together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:40.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}when you see this interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:40.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}この内装見たら全部しっくりくるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}This is, this is wild, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}これは…これはヤバいって、マジで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:00:56.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}See that stitching?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:00:56.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}このステッチ見てよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We took the exact factory pattern
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}純正とまったく同じパターンにしたから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.90,0:01:01.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}so it still looks like the factory SV.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.90,0:01:01.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ちゃんと純正のSVに見えるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:02.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:02.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}最高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Look crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}見た目ヤバすぎ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:11.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}♪ Ooh, for this life I cannot change
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:11.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}♪ この生き方は変えられねえ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}♪ Hidden Hills
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}♪ Hidden Hills
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.55,0:01:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I just, I was, like, shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.55,0:01:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}もう、なんていうか、衝撃だった
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:19.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Like, we were, like, mocking it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:19.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}モックアップ作ったりして
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:22.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}went through mad colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:22.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you know, to try to get it right,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:22.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ちょうどいい色を探して
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:22.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}色をめっちゃ試したんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:24.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and it just looked
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:24.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}way better in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:24.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}実物のほうが断然よかった
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It was, like, crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}マジでヤバかった
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Man, I'm, like, ready to run
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}off this camera right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}もう今すぐカメラの前から
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}飛び出したいくらいだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:32.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:32.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ヤバい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:33.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:33.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}テンション上がりすぎてる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:35.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Mad thankful, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:35.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}マジで感謝してる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ヤバいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}最高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.25,0:01:39.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.25,0:01:39.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}よし、行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.85,0:01:40.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It's lit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.85,0:01:40.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}アガるぜ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:50.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So Travis just came,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:50.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}he picked up his Lambo,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:50.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Travisが来て Lamboを受け取って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and he's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}喜んでくれたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So I feel like today was a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}今日はいい日だったな
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I kind of gave him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}a couple sneak peeks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}どんな仕上がりになるか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}何回かチラ見せはしてたんだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}of what it was gonna look like,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}どんな仕上がりになるか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}何回かチラ見せはしてたんだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.82,0:01:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}but then I was like, you know what,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.82,0:01:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}やっぱりサプライズにしたいなって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:01:59.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I want this thing to be a surprise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:01:59.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}やっぱりサプライズにしたいなって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:02.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}because in pictures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:02.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you can't really see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:02.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}写真じゃこの色の本当の感じは
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:03.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}what this color looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:03.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}わからないからね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:05.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So today he got to see
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:05.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}it for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:05.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}で、今日初めて実物を見て
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and he loved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}すごく気に入ってくれた
